{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lus\u00f3fona Games Collection 2025 is a curated bundle showcasing the best projects developed at Lus\u00f3fona University.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of indie creativity with this exciting collection of six games developed by students and staff in the Videogames bachelor\u2019s degree program! Born from game jams and project-based classes, each title offers a unique experience\u2014paired with exclusive developer commentary that takes you behind the scenes of their creative journey. Discover the passion, talent, and innovation driving the next generation of game developers! <br><br><strong>Featured games:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights Out - Third Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timeless - Second Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heed My Call - Third Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Breath - Staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go P!ss Grl - Second Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occam's Razor - Staff</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These games are bite-sized vertical slices\u2014glimpses into bigger ideas\u2014designed to showcase core gameplay and key features. They may not be full releases, but they\u2019re packed with heart, creativity, and potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you have as much fun playing them as we had bringing them to life!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886350?t=1774225297","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886350?t=1774225297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886350/d06503797cb4dc823ee03e2e6df73d490a62ea71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774225297","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886350/d06503797cb4dc823ee03e2e6df73d490a62ea71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774225297","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, corpses, skeletons, summoning demons and references to urine."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lus\u00f3fona Games Collection 2025 is a curated bundle showcasing the best projects developed at Lus\u00f3fona University.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of indie creativity with this exciting collection of six games developed by students and staff in the Videogames bachelor\u2019s degree program! Born from game jams and project-based classes, each title offers a unique experience\u2014paired with exclusive developer commentary that takes you behind the scenes of their creative journey. Discover the passion, talent, and innovation driving the next generation of game developers! <br><br><strong>Featured games:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights Out - Third Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timeless - Second Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heed My Call - Third Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Breath - Staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go P!ss Grl - Second Year</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occam's Razor - Staff</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These games are bite-sized vertical slices\u2014glimpses into bigger ideas\u2014designed to showcase core gameplay and key features. They may not be full releases, but they\u2019re packed with heart, creativity, and potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_p